\newlabel{fig:bigbirdfamily}{{4}{23}{BigBird-family IMDb F1 at 768 tokens (left) and 8{,}000 tokens (right). All BigBird variants stay within 0.005 F1 of dense attention at 768 tokens while training 12--14.7$\times $ slower; at 8{,}000 tokens the teleport-augmented variant reaches the family's best F1 (0.940) in 4.9$\times $ less time than plain BigBird}{figure.caption.53}{}}
